  "description": "The Reilly Fusion is a premium titanium road bike combining classic race geometry with aerodynamic hydroformed titanium tubes. The Fusion is lightweight and fast, crafted with investment-cast details such as the \"kamm fin\" shaped tubes. It offers a unique titanium alternative to carbon road bikes while delivering exceptional performance and ride quality.\nNeil FitzGerald, Reilly Co-founder, says of the launch: “Reilly’s Fusion is spearheading the titanium road revolution. It symbolises an exciting time for us, marking a new chapter as we build on our framebuilding heritage, while continuing to innovate to offer all customers their dream ride. We have raised the bar again for road adventurers to create a truly cutting edge bicycle frame to enjoy the great outdoors, whether that’s planning an ultra endurance road trip or sleekly navigating the daily commute.”",
